@page "/"
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Home";
}

<section class="hero">
    <h1>Precision castings and machining, made to last</h1>
    <p>Meridian Castings has been supplying precision-cast and machined components to demanding industries since 1962. From our foundries in Sheffield and Poznan and our machining plant in Wrexham, we turn complex drawings into parts that run for decades in the field.</p>
    <p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/products">Explore our products</a></p>
</section>

<section class="cards">
    <article class="card">
        <h2>Castings</h2>
        <p>Sand and investment castings in grey iron, ductile iron, carbon steel and aluminium alloys, from half a kilogram to well over four hundred.</p>
        <p><a href="/products/castings">View our castings capability</a></p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
        <h2>Quality you can audit</h2>
        <p>Every casting is traceable from raw material to final inspection, under a quality system built around ISO 9001, IATF 16949 and AS9100D.</p>
        <p><a href="/quality">Read about our quality management</a></p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
        <h2>Careers at Meridian</h2>
        <p>Around 860 people across three countries keep our furnaces, machines and offices running. We are usually recruiting for one plant or another.</p>
        <p><a href="/careers">See current openings</a></p>
    </article>
</section>

